end="1:17.142">で</span></p><p begin="1:17.526" end="1:20.226" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:17.526" end="1:17.906">誰</span><span begin="1:17.906" end="1:18.106">に</span><span begin="1:18.106" end="1:18.266">も</span><span begin="1:18.266" end="1:18.496">触</span><span begin="1:18.496" end="1:18.636">れ</span><span begin="1:18.636" end="1:19.026">ない</span><span begin="1:19.026" end="1:20.226">で</span></p><p begin="1:20.449" end="1:24.979" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:20.449" end="1:20.969">私</span><span begin="1:20.969" end="1:21.209">が</span><span begin="1:21.209" end="1:21.349">い</span><span begin="1:21.349" end="1:21.469">る</span><span begin="1:21.469" end="1:21.719">か</span><span begin="1:21.719" end="1:22.999">ら</span> <span begin="1:23.589" end="1:24.209">隣</span><span begin="1:24.209" end="1:24.369">い</span><span begin="1:24.369" end="1:24.499">る</span><span begin="1:24.499" end="1:24.729">か</span><span begin="1:24.729" end="1:24.979">ら</span></p><p begin="1:24.971" end="1:27.691" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:24.971" end="1:25.501">ねぇ</span> <span begin="1:25.501" end="1:25.901">Boo</span> <span begin="1:26.291" end="1:26.611">I'm</span> <span begin="1:26.611" end="1:26.941">so</span> <span begin="1:26.941" end="1:27.331">ha</span><span begin="1:27.331" end="1:27.691">ppy</span></p><p begin="1:27.969" end="1:30.829" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:27.969" end="1:28.359">君</span><span begin="1:28.359" end="1:28.499">の</span><span begin="1:28.499" end="1:28.759">た</span><span begin="1:28.759" end="1:28.939">め</span><span begin="1:28.939" end="1:29.129">な</span><span begin="1:29.129" end="1:29.319">ら</span> <span begin="1:29.319" end="1:29.469">I</span> <span begin="1:29.469" end="1:29.689">can</span> <span begin="1:29.689" end="1:29.879">be</span> <span begin="1:29.879" end="1:30.039">your</span> <span begin="1:30.039" end="1:30.529">Jas</span><span begin="1:30.529" end="1:30.829">mine</span></p><p begin="1:31.024" end="1:35.424" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:31.024" end="1:31.204">照</span><span begin="1:31.204" end="1:31.344">れ</span><span begin="1:31.344" end="1:31.524">く</span><span begin="1:31.524" end="1:31.784">さ</span><span begin="1:31.784" end="1:31.914">く</span><span begin="1:31.914" end="1:32.314">て</span> <span begin="1:32.574" end="1:32.884">いつ</span><span begin="1:32.884" end="1:33.124">も</span><span begin="1:33.124" end="1:33.294">言</span><span begin="1:33.294" end="1:33.424">え</span><span begin="1:33.424" end="1:33.674">な</span><span begin="1:33.674" end="1:33.814">い</span><span begin="1:33.814" end="1:34.244">け</span><span begin="1:34.244" end="1:34.534">ど</span><span begin="1:34.534" end="1:35.424">さ</span></p><p begin="1:35.880" end="1:39.250" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:35.880" end="1:36.510">愛</span><span begin="1:36.510" end="1:36.940">し</span><span begin="1:36.940" end="1:37.370">て</span><span begin="1:37.370" end="1:39.250">る</span></p><p begin="1:50.011" end="1:52.491" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:50.011" end="1:50.141">「バ</span><span begin="1:50.141" end="1:50.361">ス</span><span begin="1:50.361" end="1:50.761">一</span><span begin="1:50.761" end="1:50.901">つ</span><span begin="1:50.901" end="1:51.191">見</span><span begin="1:51.191" end="1:51.721">送</span><span begin="1:51.721" end="1:52.061">ろう</span><span begin="1:52.061" end="1:52.491">よ」</span></p><p begin="1:53.026" end="1:55.536" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:53.026" end="1:53.406">遠</span><span begin="1:53.406" end="1:53.816">回</span><span begin="1:53.816" end="1:54.016">りし</span><span begin="1:54.016" end="1:54.136">て</span><span begin="1:54.136" end="1:54.906">帰っ</span><span begin="1:54.906" end="1:55.076">て</span><span begin="1:55.076" end="1:55.536">も</span></p><p begin="1:56.069" end="1:59.299" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:56.069" end="1:56.179">ポ</span><span begin="1:56.179" end="1:56.5